{
  "slug": "imperativo",
  "number": 18,
  "part": 4,
  "level": "A2",
  "title": "Commands",
  "tagline": "Habla, hable, no hables: giving orders, directions and advice.",
  "goal": "Give positive and negative commands with tú, usted, ustedes and nosotros, use the eight irregular tú commands, and attach pronouns.",
  "minutes": 12,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "tu",
      "title": "Tú: positive commands",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The positive *tú* command is the same as the **él / ella** form of the present: *habla, come, escribe*."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": ["Eight irregular tú commands", "", "", ""],
          "rows": [
            ["*decir → {di}*", "*hacer → {haz}*", "*ir → {ve}*", "*poner → {pon}*"],
            ["*salir → {sal}*", "*ser → {sé}*", "*tener → {ten}*", "*venir → {ven}*"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "tip",
          "text": "A memory trick: «Di, haz, ve, pon, sal, sé, ten, ven», say it as a little chant."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "usted",
      "title": "Usted, ustedes, nosotros and negatives",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "All the other commands use the **present subjunctive**: take the yo form, drop -o, and switch the vowel (-ar → e, -er / -ir → a)."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": ["Infinitive", "usted", "ustedes", "nosotros (let's)", "no + tú"],
          "rows": [
            ["*hablar*", "*hable*", "*hablen*", "*hablemos*", "*no hables*"],
            ["*comer*", "*coma*", "*coman*", "*comamos*", "*no comas*"],
            ["*hacer* (hago)", "*haga*", "*hagan*", "*hagamos*", "*no hagas*"],
            ["*ir*", "*vaya*", "*vayan*", "*vamos*", "*no vayas*"],
            ["*ser*", "*sea*", "*sean*", "*seamos*", "*no seas*"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "note",
          "text": "Spelling changes keep the sound: *buscar → busque*, *llegar → llegue*, *empezar → empiece*."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pronombres",
      "title": "Commands with pronouns",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Positive commands: pronouns **attach to the end** (add an accent to keep the stress). Negative commands: pronouns go **before** the verb."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "head": ["Positive", "Negative"],
          "rows": [
            ["*Dí{melo}.*", "*No {me lo} digas.*"],
            ["*Siénta{te}.*", "*No {te} sientes.*"],
            ["*Lláme{me}, por favor.*", "*No {me} llame.*"],
            ["*Vámo{nos}.*", "*No {nos} vayamos.*"]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "tu",
      "section": "tu",
      "title": "Tú commands",
      "instructions": "Write the positive tú command.",
      "kind": "type",
      "items": [
        { "prompt": "___ más despacio, por favor. (hablar)", "answer": "Habla" },
